OL,3,GNEWSA'Get down': Stamford man recounts
OL,4,AKrakow shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Lincolnshire has described
OL,7,Fhow he escaped a shooting in Poland
OL,8,Fthat killed six people.
OL,10,FAndrew Hill, from Stamford, was in
OL,11,FKrakow for a weekend with his family
OL,12,Fwhen the attack in the city's main
OL,13,Fmarket square began on Saturday
OL,14,Fafternoon.
OL,16,FHe said he took shelter in a nearby
OL,17,Fshop, jumping on fellow tourists,
OL,18,Fincluding a child, and shouted "get
OL,19,Fdown" as people screamed.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
