OL,3,GNEWSA'Get down': Stamford man recounts
OL,4,AKrakow shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gunman, who is believed to have
OL,7,Fbeen inspired by far-right ideology,
OL,8,Falso injured more than a dozen others
OL,9,Fbefore being shot by police. He remains
OL,10,Fin a critical condition in hospital.
